OL,3,GNEWSASkegness women celebrated in phone
OL,4,Abox in Germany
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British phone box featuring the
OL,7,Fstories of 23 women is starring in a
OL,8,Fphotography exhibition in Germany.
OL,10,FArtist John Byford photographed and
OL,11,Finterviewed the women ` aged 23 to 96 `
OL,12,Ffrom Skegness, Lincolnshire, for a
OL,13,Fproject called Her/Sie (she).
OL,15,FThe exhibition in Bad Gandersheim,
OL,16,FLower Saxony, which is twinned with
OL,17,FSkegness, coincides with celebrations
OL,18,Fof the town's most famous daughter, the
OL,19,F10th Century German writer Roswitha.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
