OL,3,GNEWSASkegness women celebrated in phone
OL,4,Abox in Germany
OL,5,
OL,6,FByford said: "They're wonderful
OL,7,Fstories. Some of them are very sad,
OL,8,Fvery emotional. All the stories are
OL,9,Fthere for people to read, and they all
OL,10,Fgrace this telephone box."
